    file-specific GPLv3 Section 7 notice, which must be preserved.

    morphe-bytecode
    https://github.com/crimera/morphe-bytecode
    Copyright (C) 2026 crimera
    Licensed under GPL-3.0-or-later.

    Reseam - Rust APK patching engine with a Kotlin patch API
    https://github.com/Reseam/reseam
    Copyright (C) 2026 AunAli K. <hello@auna.li>
    Licensed under GPL-3.0-or-later. Some helper naming follows the Reseam
