Modified version
----------------

This is a modified version of Piko Patches Library, maintained at
https://github.com/juanmacasado/piko-patches-library (branch `mount`).
It is not affiliated with or endorsed by the upstream authors.

Modifications Copyright (C) 2026 juanmacasado, licensed under the same
terms. Changes made on 2026-11-27:

- Added app.morphe.extension.crimera.mount.MountComponents, which hosts
  extension activities and receivers in non-exported stock components
  so they work on mount (root) installs.
- The downloader folder picker and notification receivers route their
  intents through MountComponents.

The full list of changes is in the git history of the fork.
